CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fm_key->fiemap.fm_start <
 		    fm_key->oa.o_size'
#61: FILE: drivers/staging/lustre/lustre/lov/lov_obd.c:1736:
+		if (lsm && lsm_is_released(lsm) && (fm_key->fiemap.fm_start <
+		    fm_key->oa.o_size)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

